# TUI (`codex-rs/tui/src/`)

ratatui-based terminal UI. Key modules:

- `app.rs` — central orchestration (keep under 800 LoC; prefer new modules)
- `chatwidget.rs` — chat rendering (avoid standalone methods here)
- `bottom_pane/` — composer, footer, input (see nested `AGENTS.md`)
- `diff_render.rs` — git diff display
- `app_server_session.rs` — remote app-server sessions
- `wrapping.rs` — text wrapping helpers
- `styles.md` — colors: cyan=user tips, green=success, red=error, magenta=agent; avoid custom colors

## Conventions

- Use Stylize helpers (`"text".dim()`, `.red()`, `.cyan()`) not manual `Style`.
- Snapshot tests (`insta`) required for user-visible UI changes.
- Use `textwrap::wrap` and helpers in `wrapping.rs` for text wrapping.
- See root `AGENTS.md` for detailed TUI style and module-size rules.
